---
import { getImage } from "astro:assets";
import titleCh2Url from "../../assets/chapter2/title_ch2.svg?url";
import tapeLukasUrl from "../../assets/chapter2/titleCh02_01.png?url";
import margielaSrc from "../../assets/chapter2/martin_margiela.png";
import flowerSrc from "../../assets/intro/pink_flower.png";
import InfoReveal from "./InfoReveal.astro";
import tapeWorldUrl from "../../assets/chapter2/titleCh02_02.png?url";
import vivBowieSrc from "../../assets/chapter2/viv_bowie.png";

const margiela = await getImage({ src: margielaSrc, format: "webp" });
const flower = await getImage({ src: flowerSrc, format: "webp" });
const vivBowie = await getImage({ src: vivBowieSrc, format: "webp" });
---

<div class="chapter2">
    <div class="chapter2__header">
        <p class="chapter2__eyebrow">Chapter 2</p>

        <div class="chapter2__title-wrap">
            <img
                src={titleCh2Url}
                alt=""
                aria-hidden="true"
                class="chapter2__title-img"
            />
            <h2 class="visually-hidden">Formative Years</h2>
        </div>

        <img
            src={flower.src}
            alt=""
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="chapter2__flower"
        />
    </div>

    <div class="chapter2__lukas-wrap">
        <section class="chapter2__block chapter2__block--lukas">
            <div class="chapter2__label-wrap">
                <img
                    src={tapeLukasUrl}
                    alt=""
                    aria-hidden="true"
                    class="chapter2__label-img"
                />
                <h3 class="visually-hidden">
                    St. Lukas Institute of Fine Arts and Martin Margiela
                </h3>
            </div>

            <p class="chapter2__paragraph chapter2__paragraph--first">
                By fifteen, Marina's world was beginning to open up beyond the
                one she had created at home. She enrolled at the St. Lukas
                Institute of Fine Arts in Hasselt, bringing the interests she
                had explored mostly on her own into the art school.
            </p>

            <img
                src={margiela.src}
                alt=""
                aria-hidden="true"
                class="chapter2__margiela"
            />

            <p class="chapter2__paragraph chapter2__paragraph--second">
                Here, her distinctive way of dressing caught the attention of
                Martin Margiela, another soon to be famous fashion designer. He
                was drawn to what he called Marina's "crazy combinations", and
                the two quickly became close because of their shared fascination
                with clothing and art. For Marina, this was also the beginning
                of a new kind of creative companionship — she now had someone
                with whom she could exchange ideas instead of exploring them
                entirely on her own.
            </p>
        </section>

        <div class="chapter2__quote-wrap">
            <blockquote class="chapter2__quote">
                <span
                    class="chapter2__quote-mark chapter2__quote-mark--open"
                    aria-hidden="true">"</span
                >
                <p class="chapter2__quote-text">
                    He loved my weird combinations. He thought they were
                    fantastic. And so we had something in common, a shared
                    passion for fashion and clothes.
                </p>
                <span
                    class="chapter2__quote-mark chapter2__quote-mark--close"
                    aria-hidden="true">"</span
                >
            </blockquote>
            <p class="chapter2__quote-attribution">— Marina Yee</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <section class="chapter2__block chapter2__block--world">
        <div class="chapter2__world-info-wrap">
            <InfoReveal
                id="world-info-panel"
                title="Some cultural context"
                text={`By the 1970s, David Bowie turned clothing, makeup and image into an essential part of performance, working with designers such as Kansai Yamamoto to create identities that could change from one appearance to the next. In London, punk pushed things even further. Vivienne Westwood and Malcolm McLaren brought music and clothing together around a scene that lived in shops, clubs and on the street rather than inside traditional couture.`}
            >
                <div class="chapter2__label-wrap">
                    <img
                        src={tapeWorldUrl}
                        alt=""
                        aria-hidden="true"
                        class="chapter2__label-img--world"
                    />
                    <h3 class="visually-hidden">The world around</h3>
                </div>
                <p class="chapter2__paragraph">
                    At the same time, the world around Marina was changing too.
                    The spirit of the late 1960s had pushed a younger generation
                    to question the values and rules they had inherited, and
                    that rebellion soon found its way into art, music and
                    fashion. For young creatives, inspiration was no longer
                    coming from the established fashion houses of Paris or
                    Milan.
                </p>
            </InfoReveal>
            <a
                href="https://heron.libis.be/momu/s/studiecollectie/page/mode1980"
                target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer"
                class="chapter2__link">Learn more about fashion in the '80s</a
            >
        </div>
        <img
            src={vivBowie.src}
            alt=""
            aria-hidden="true"
            class="chapter2__viv-bowie"
        />
    </section>
</div>

<style>
    /* Martin section */
    .chapter2 {
        padding: 4rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .chapter2__header {
        position: relative;
    }

    .chapter2__flower {
        display: none;
    }

    .chapter2__eyebrow {
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        font-family: var(--font-family-serif);
        font-weight: var(--weight-bold);
        color: var(--color-text-main);
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .chapter2__title-img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 23rem;
        height: auto;
        margin-bottom: 4rem;
    }

    .chapter2__lukas-wrap {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 2rem;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .chapter2__block--lukas {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-areas:
            "label"
            "para1"
            "image"
            "para2";
        justify-items: center;
    }

    .chapter2__label-wrap {
        grid-area: label;
        justify-self: center;
    }

    .chapter2__paragraph--first {
        grid-area: para1;
    }

    .chapter2__margiela {
        grid-area: image;
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 20rem;
        height: auto;
        margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .chapter2__paragraph--second {
        grid-area: para2;
    }

    .chapter2__label-img {
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        max-width: 20rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        margin-inline: auto;
    }

    .chapter2__paragraph {
        font-size: var(--step-0);
        color: var(--color-text-main);
        text-align: justify;
    }

    .chapter2__quote-mark {
        display: block;
        font-family: var(--font-family-punktype);
        font-weight: var(--weight-black, 900);
        font-size: 5rem;
        line-height: 1;
        color: var(--color-text-main);
    }

    .chapter2__quote-mark--close {
        text-align: right;
    }

    .chapter2__quote-text {
        font-family: var(--font-family-bestieseventy);
        font-size: var(--step-4);
        line-height: 2rem;
        color: var(--color-text-main);
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .chapter2__quote-attribution {
        text-align: right;
        font-family: var(--font-family-bestieseventy);
        font-size: var(--step-4);
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
        color: var(--color-text-main);
        margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    /* World around section */
    .chapter2__label-img--world {
        width: 100%;
        height: auto;
        max-width: 18rem;
        margin-inline: auto;
        padding-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .chapter2__block--world {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-areas:
            "info"
            "photo";
        gap: 2rem;
        padding-top: 3rem;
        justify-items: center;
    }

    .chapter2__world-info-wrap {
        grid-area: info;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 1rem;
    }

    .chapter2__link {
        text-decoration: underline;
        font-family: var(--font-family-sans);
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
        font-size: var(--step-2);
    }

    .chapter2__viv-bowie {
        grid-area: photo;
        display: block;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 22rem;
        height: auto;
        margin-inline: auto;
    }

    @media (min-width: 48rem) {
        /* Martin section */
        .chapter2 {
            padding: 2rem 6rem;
        }

        .chapter2__flower {
            display: block;
            position: absolute;
            top: 7rem;
            right: 8rem;
            width: 6rem;
            height: auto;
            object-fit: contain;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: -1;
        }

        .chapter2__title-img {
            max-width: 60rem;
        }

        .chapter2__block--lukas {
            display: grid;
            width: 100%;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.5fr;
            grid-template-areas:
                "image label"
                "image para1"
                "image para2";
            justify-content: center;
            grid-template-rows: 9rem 8rem 11rem;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }

        .chapter2__margiela {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            max-width: 35rem;
            margin-inline: 0;
        }

        .chapter2__label-img {
            max-width: 22rem;
        }

        .chapter2__paragraph {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 32rem;
        }

        .chapter2__quote-wrap {
            width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            max-width: 68rem;
            margin-top: 10rem;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .chapter2__quote-mark {
            font-size: 7rem;
        }

        .chapter2__quote-text {
            text-align: left;
            line-height: 2.5rem;
        }

        /* World around section */
        .chapter2__block--world {
            grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, 480px) 1fr;
            grid-template-areas: "info photo";
            align-items: start;
            gap: 3rem;
        }

        .chapter2__viv-bowie {
            max-width: 48rem;
            margin-inline: 0;
        }
    }
</style>
